{{> Top}}<article class="prose">
<h1>History</h1>
<p>The best of each night&rsquo;s rounds, race by race. A line that jumps is a commit: every race&rsquo;s <a href="/data/index.json">data</a> names the commits it raced.</p>
</article>
<section id="history" class="results">
